graph TD
    %% Transcription and RNA Production
    A[rrn Operon Transcription] --> B[Primary rRNA Transcript]
    B --> C[RNase III Cleavage]
    C --> D[16S rRNA Precursor]
    C --> E[23S rRNA Precursor]
    C --> F[5S rRNA Precursor]
    
    %% 30S Assembly Pathway
    D --> G[16S rRNA Folding]
    G --> H[5' Domain Formation]
    H --> I{Early Proteins<br/>Available?}
    
    I -->|Yes| J[Primary Binding Proteins]
    J --> K[S4 S8 S15 S17 S20 Binding]
    K --> L[Central Domain Stabilization]
    L --> M{Secondary Proteins<br/>Ready?}
    
    M -->|Yes| N[Secondary Binding Proteins]
    N --> O[S2 S3 S5 S7 S9 S10 S14 S19 Binding]
    O --> P[3' Domain Formation]
    P --> Q{Tertiary Proteins<br/>Ready?}
    
    Q -->|Yes| R[Tertiary Binding Proteins]
    R --> S[S6 S11 S12 S13 S18 S21 Binding]
    S --> T[Pre-30S Particle]
    
    %% 30S Maturation
    T --> U[RimM Chaperone Action]
    U --> V[16S 3' End Processing]
    V --> W[KsgA Methylation]
    W --> X[Era GTPase Quality Check]
    X --> ANDGATE1{Correctly Folded AND<br/>Modified?}
    
    ANDGATE1 -->|Yes| Y[Mature 30S Subunit]
    ANDGATE1 -->|No| Z[/Degradation or Repair/]
    
    %% 50S Assembly Pathway
    E --> AA[23S rRNA Folding]
    F --> AB[5S rRNA Folding]
    
    AA --> AC[Domain I Formation]
    AC --> AD{Early 50S Proteins<br/>Available?}
    
    AD -->|Yes| AE[L4 L13 L20 L22 Binding]
    AE --> AF[Central Protuberance Assembly]
    AF --> AG[L1 L2 L3 L6 L10 L11 Binding]
    
    AB --> AH[5S-L5-L18 Complex]
    AH --> AI[5S Integration]
    AI --> AF
    
    AG --> AJ{Late 50S Proteins<br/>Ready?}
    AJ -->|Yes| AK[Remaining Protein Binding]
    AK --> AL[L7/L12 Stalk Formation]
    AL --> AM[Pre-50S Particle]
    
    %% 50S Maturation
    AM --> AN[23S rRNA Modifications]
    AN --> AO[RlmE Methylation]
    AO --> AP[RluD Pseudouridylation]
    AP --> AQ[ObgE GTPase Action]
    AQ --> ANDGATE2{Correctly Assembled AND<br/>Peptidyl Transferase Active?}
    
    ANDGATE2 -->|Yes| AR[Mature 50S Subunit]
    ANDGATE2 -->|No| AS[/Degradation/]
    
    %% 70S Formation
    Y --> AT[30S in Cytoplasm]
    AR --> AU[50S in Cytoplasm]
    
    AT --> AV{Subunits<br/>Available?}
    AU --> AV
    
    AV -->|Yes| AW[30S-50S Association]
    AW --> AX[70S Ribosome Formation]
    AX --> AY[Functional Translation Complex]
    
    %% Quality Control
    AY --> AZ[Translation Competence Test]
    AZ --> BA{Functional?}
    BA -->|Yes| BB[Active Ribosome Pool]
    BA -->|No| BC[Ribosome Recycling]
    
